# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock IS committed. This is an application/binary project, not a
# library: a locked dependency graph keeps builds and simulation reproducible.
# (The default GitHub Rust template ignores it; that rule is deliberately
#  removed here.)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-local configuration — NEVER commit
# Holds absolute paths to a locally installed game client.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
config.toml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LEGAL: no Blizzard game assets, and no files derived from them, may enter
# this repository. Tools, parsers and readers are committed; assets stay on
# the user's own machine and are read at runtime through config.toml paths.
#
# The exported trees below normally live OUTSIDE this repo (in the reference
# project). These rules are a second line of defence against accidentally
# copying them in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Classic-client archives and their binary formats
*.mpq
*.MPQ
*.w3x
*.w3m
*.w3e
*.w3i
*.w3r
*.w3u
*.wpm
*.doo
*.blp
*.BLP
*.mdx
*.MDX
*.mdl
*.MDL
*.slk
*.SLK
*.tga
*.pcx

# Exported / derived asset trees (JSON, PNG, GLB, sounds produced from MPQ)
/assets-export/
/assets/slk-exported/
/assets/map-parsed/
/assets/asset-converted/
/.cache/

# NOTE: do NOT add a blanket *.png / *.wav ignore here — the project's own
# documentation images and original source media must remain committable.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local working files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
